{s:OUT,k:'outro',term:'Outro',say:'So remember: a cosine makes two half copies, energy is the same both ways, and a filter scales and delays each frequency. That is why the whistle came late. Next time, distortionless transmission, ideal filters and realizability. See you there!',cues:{f:'So remember',w1:'a cosine makes',w2:'energy is the same',w3:'a filter scales',n:'Next time',s:'See you there'},words:[['TWO HALF COPIES','BLU','w1'],['SAME ENERGY BOTH WAYS','ORG','w2'],['GAIN AND PHASE','GRN','w3']],next:["NEXT TIME", "Next lesson", "Distortionless transmission, ideal filters and realizability · Correlation and spectral density of signals · Hilbert transform and its properties", "book"],end:'See you there!'}
